# TBCGuide - Searing Gorge (47-50), both factions
# Copyright (C) 2026 GREYsaurus (https://github.com/GREYsaurus) - GPL-3.0-only. Original route and notes.

@guide Both_SearingGorge
@name Searing Gorge (Thorium Point)
@faction Both
@levels 47-50
@zone Searing Gorge
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Thorium Point's bounty board and Hansel Heavyhands' hunts, then Kalaran Windblade's chain: the Flawless Flame, the Twilight shamans and setting the sentry braziers ablaze. Neutral hub, same route for both factions.
@next Both_UngoroCrater

note Alliance: fly to Thelsamar, ride south into the Badlands and west past Kargath (Horde town) into the Searing Gorge. Horde: fly to Kargath and ride west. Thorium Point is in the north-west of the Gorge. Most quests here need level 45.
fp Thorium Point
accept STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass | The Wanted board at Thorium Point.
accept JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition | Same board.
accept Curse These Fat Fingers | Hansel Heavyhands.
accept Fiery Menace! | Hansel Heavyhands.
accept Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It | Hansel Heavyhands.
accept Divine Retribution | Kalaran Windblade, sitting by the ruined tower south of Thorium Point.
turnin Divine Retribution
accept The Flawless Flame
complete Fiery Menace! | Greater Lava Spiders all around Thorium Point.
complete Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It | Incendosaurs at the lava lake east of Thorium Point.
complete The Flawless Flame [obj=1] | Heart of Flame from Blazing Elementals in the middle of the Gorge.
complete JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition | Dark Iron Taskmasters and Slavers around the Cauldron.
complete STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass | Tuyere from Dark Iron Steamsmiths, Spyglass from Dark Iron Lookouts, around the Cauldron.
complete Curse These Fat Fingers | Heavy War Golems in the south-west of the Gorge.
complete The Flawless Flame [obj=2] | Golem Oil from Tempered War Golems in the south-east.
turnin The Flawless Flame | Kalaran Windblade.
accept Forging the Shaft
complete Forging the Shaft | Thorium Plated Dagger drops from Dark Iron Geologists at the dig in the east.
turnin Forging the Shaft | Kalaran Windblade.
accept The Flame's Casing
complete The Flame's Casing | Symbol of Ragnaros drops from Twilight Dark Shamans at the Twilight camp in the west.
turnin The Flame's Casing
accept 3453 The Torch of Retribution
turnin 3453 The Torch of Retribution
accept 3454 The Torch of Retribution
turnin 3454 The Torch of Retribution | Take the Torch of Retribution from beside Kalaran.
accept Squire Maltrake
turnin Squire Maltrake | Squire Maltrake appears next to the torch.
accept Set Them Ablaze!
complete Set Them Ablaze! | Light the two Sentry Braziers at the south edge of the Gorge, by the Blackrock Mountain bridge. Dark Iron sentries stand nearby.
turnin Set Them Ablaze! | Squire Maltrake.
turnin STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass | Taskmaster Scrange, Thorium Point.
turnin JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition
turnin Curse These Fat Fingers | Hansel Heavyhands.
turnin Fiery Menace!
turnin Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It
level 49
train
note Fly from Thorium Point to Ironforge (Alliance) or Kargath / Orgrimmar (Horde), and on to Un'Goro Crater through Tanaris (Gadgetzan) or Marshal's Refuge if you have it.
